### Structural and Value Tree Equality

```python
def isSameTree(p, q):
    if not p and not q:
        return True
    if not p or not q or p.val != q.val:
        return False
    return isSameTree(p.left, q.left) and isSameTree(p.right, q.right)
```

- **Time Complexity:** $O(n)$
- **Space Complexity:** $O(h)$
